# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Next.js build output
.next/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv*

# Environment (never commit real secrets)
.env

# Corporate root CA — copied into build context locally, never committed
apps/collector/somansa-root.crt

# Storage: keep folder structure, ignore uploaded/processed files
storage/raw/*
storage/processed/*
storage/trigger/*.json
!storage/**/.gitkeep

# Windows / WSL artifacts
*Zone.Identifier

# macOS
.DS_Store

# [시장 시그널] markets.ttl 은 build_graph.py 가 매일 굽는 **생성물**이다.
# 런타임 기본 경로는 /app/.cache/market_signal/ (named volume)이고, 로컬 개발에서만
# 패키지 옆에 떨어진다 — 어느 쪽이든 커밋하지 않는다(낡은 데이터가 이미지에 실린다).
apps/collector/collector/market_signal/markets.ttl
